{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9b96575469666f55","name":"Pocket Scrambler","source":{"id":"source:reference-9b96575469666f55","title":"Pocket Scrambler","revision":18409,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:05:10Z","sha256":"2a63650c236429dc48f56404bd2ffee30c07a0d1758467adb4072dbf8f650e43","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18409","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pocket%20Scrambler&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9b96575469666f55","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This is a simple add-on device that can be attached to any normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Communications Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Communications_Device"},", such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," and more advanced transceiver. The Pocket Scrambler automatically encodes any outgoing message so that it can be read only by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Communications Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Communications_Device"}," equipped with a linked Pocket Scrambler. Anyone who intercepts the scrambled message must make a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to decrypt it.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
